==Event Information==
The fragile giant sunfish Mola Mola returns to the Cat Army for one more adventure with the Battle Cats... Login today and check out newly added difficulty Level 4 challenges for the return of the "Survive! Mola Mola" collab! <br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from September 13th (11am) thru 20th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● "Survive! Mola Mola!" Limited Capsule Set!'''}}<br>
Only now, visit the Rare Capsule Machine and tap the "Survive! Mola Mola!" tab at the top of the menu to draw for a special set including Mola Mola! units available only from this collaboration event! Limited edition heroes in this set include:

[[Mola King (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00CCFF|'''King Mola (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
No enemy can withstand the area attack of his piercing cry! Stun baddies into submission from a safe distance!

[[Baby Mola (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Baby Mola (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A living miracle, the only survivor of a family of millions! Suffers from low HP, but is a fierce long-distance attacker when protected by high-defense Cats!

※Please note that draws from the Survive! Mola Mola! rare capsule setmay provide regularly appearing rare Cat units. "Survive! Mola Mola!" collab units will not be available from other scheduled Rare Capsule sets appearing during the collaboration.<br>
※If "Survive! Mola Mola!" content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Limited Collab Stages in The Battle Cats app!'''}}<br>
The return of "Survive! Mola Mola!" collab stages, along with a brand new challenge! Fight fishy foes from the Mola Mola universe and earn awesome rewards!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Collab Map "Survive! Mola Mola!" Returns, with new, tougher Level 4 challenges!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stories during this campaign, tap "Battle", and select the{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Survive! Mola Mola!'''}}Map to begin the challenge!<br>
Clearing any stage in this map will give a small chance to pick up the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Limited Collab Unit "'''}}[[Meowla Meowla (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Meowla Meowla'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|'''"'''}}as a reward!<br>
Later, more difficult stages in the map will give a higher chance to collect Meowla Meowla as a clear reward!<br>
(Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect stage clear rewards!)

※ Meowla Meowla cannot be collected again if already picked up from a previous Survive! Mola Mola! event.<br>
※ Meowla Meowla can be activated at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a stage reward.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collab Map "300 Million Dead Molas" Returns, with new, tougher Level 4 challenges!'''}}
In these Timed Score stages, you will earn bigger and better rewards the higher your final score result! Clear the stage faster to earn a better score and get the best prizes!

※ Tap the Timed Score button on the "300 Million Dead Molas" map screen to view all possible score rewards.<br>
※ If the collab stages do not appear, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● NEW Gauntlet Map: "Manbosaki Strikes!"'''}}
Put your skills to the test with a limited edition "Survive! Mola Mola" challenge: the extra-tough Gauntlet map "Manbosaki Strikes!", found at the Legend/Event Stages!<br>
Each stage, your fearsome foe Ayumi Manbosaki will grow stronger... Can you make it all the way to the ultimate challenge at Level 12 and earn all the glorious rewards?

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Survive! Mola Mola stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!

※These Special missions can only be completed until September 20th at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

Download Survive! Mola Mola at the link below:<br>
http://selectbutton.jp/apps/manbo/

